Repair or Replace? How to Decide
Not sure whether your sofa is worth repairing? Use this simple guide.
Repair is usually the better choice if:
•	The frame is solid or has only minor damage
•	The problem is sagging, tears, loose joints or worn fabric
•	You like the design and size of the sofa
•	The sofa is a good-quality piece you paid a decent amount for
Replacement may be worth considering if:
•	The frame is badly rotted or infested by termites throughout
•	The sofa was always uncomfortable and you never liked its shape
•	Repair costs would be close to the price of a similar new sofa
We will tell you honestly if a sofa is not worth repairing. That is part of the free inspection.

