Tips to Make Your Sofa Last Longer
•	Rotate and flip cushions every few weeks so wear is even.
•	Do not let children jump on the sofa or sit on the arms.
•	Keep the sofa away from direct sunlight, which fades fabric and dries leather.
•	Vacuum regularly to remove dust and grit that wears fabric.
•	Clean spills quickly. Blot, do not rub.
•	Keep the sofa a little away from walls and heaters.
•	Fix small problems early. A loose joint or opened seam gets worse fast.

